1
00:00:00,257 --> 00:00:02,140
AT TWO SEVENTEEN A.M.,

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,995
YOU TAKE OVER WARD TEN.

3
00:00:04,015 --> 00:00:05,203
THE HANDOVER BOARD

4
00:00:05,223 --> 00:00:06,703
SAYS TEN BEDS.

5
00:00:06,723 --> 00:00:08,095
THE OBSERVATION CHART

6
00:00:08,115 --> 00:00:09,779
SAYS TEN PATIENTS.

7
00:00:09,799 --> 00:00:10,944
THE CALL-BELL LOG

8
00:00:10,964 --> 00:00:12,544
SAYS ELEVEN BELLS.

9
00:00:12,564 --> 00:00:13,552
THE EXTRA BELL

10
00:00:13,572 --> 00:00:15,152
COMES FROM BED ELEVEN.

11
00:00:15,172 --> 00:00:16,274
NO ONE WAS ADMITTED

12
00:00:16,294 --> 00:00:17,348
TO THAT BED.

13
00:00:17,368 --> 00:00:18,342
YOUR RULE:

14
00:00:18,362 --> 00:00:19,407
ANSWER EVERY BELL

15
00:00:19,427 --> 00:00:20,722
BEFORE YOU SIGN.

16
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:22,748
TEN BEDS ARE OCCUPIED.

17
00:00:22,768 --> 00:00:23,487
TEN NAMES

18
00:00:23,507 --> 00:00:24,475
ON THE CHART.

19
00:00:24,495 --> 00:00:25,768
THEN THE ELEVENTH BELL

20
00:00:25,788 --> 00:00:26,870
RINGS AGAIN.

21
00:00:26,890 --> 00:00:28,348
DOWN THE CORRIDOR,

22
00:00:28,368 --> 00:00:29,413
AN UNMARKED DOOR

23
00:00:29,433 --> 00:00:30,686
STANDS OPEN.

24
00:00:30,706 --> 00:00:31,595
AN EMPTY BED

25
00:00:31,615 --> 00:00:32,953
WAITS INSIDE.

26
00:00:32,973 --> 00:00:33,890
THE CHART STILL

27
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:34,978
SAYS TEN.

28
00:00:34,998 --> 00:00:37,189
THE DISCHARGE PRINTER STARTS.

29
00:00:37,209 --> 00:00:38,197
THE FORM SAYS

30
00:00:38,217 --> 00:00:39,321
BED ELEVEN.

31
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:43,214
THE PATIENT'S NAME

32
00:00:43,234 --> 00:00:44,245
IS YOURS.

33
00:00:44,265 --> 00:00:45,126
THE WARD ISN'T

34
00:00:45,146 --> 00:00:46,470
ADMITTING ANYONE.

35
00:00:46,490 --> 00:00:48,183
IT IS DISCHARGING YOU.

36
00:00:48,203 --> 00:00:49,334
YOUR STAFF BADGE

37
00:00:49,354 --> 00:00:50,464
GOES BLANK.

38
00:00:50,484 --> 00:00:51,459
THE PATIENT COUNT

39
00:00:51,479 --> 00:00:52,674
STAYS TEN.

40
00:00:52,694 --> 00:00:54,066
AT SHIFT CHANGE,

41
00:00:54,086 --> 00:00:55,061
THE ELEVENTH BELL

42
00:00:55,081 --> 00:00:56,149
RINGS AGAIN.

43
00:00:56,169 --> 00:00:57,044
IT IS ASKING

44
00:00:57,064 --> 00:00:59,840
FOR THE NEXT NURSE.
